WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.790
Starting an online store
is easier than you think.

00:00:03.150 --> 00:00:05.790
Let me show you how to
quickly open one with Shopify.

00:00:06.360 --> 00:00:09.540
First, go to Shopify.com
and start a free trial.

00:00:10.050 --> 00:00:12.870
Next, create a beautiful
online store without any

00:00:12.870 --> 00:00:14.310
design or coding skills.

00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:18.120
Use one of Shopify's professional
templates and easily change

00:00:18.150 --> 00:00:19.920
fonts, colors, and images.

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:21.750
Next, add products.

00:00:22.170 --> 00:00:24.480
Just upload a photo and
give your product a name,

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:26.119
description, and set a price.

00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:30.250
Activate Shopify payments and
enjoy zero transaction fees.

00:00:31.060 --> 00:00:32.290
Now let's open your store.

00:00:32.830 --> 00:00:34.790
Just remove the password and tada!

00:00:35.150 --> 00:00:37.480
Your store is live and
ready to take orders.

00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:40.180
Are you ready to join the
millions of businesses

00:00:40.180 --> 00:00:41.560
already using Shopify?

00:00:42.010 --> 00:00:44.980
Go to Shopify.com and open
your online store today.

